  "notes": "Verified live 2026-10-07 in headed Chrome. /opt-out redirects to /removal, whose form#verifyEmailForm has a requester select, first, middle and last name, email, an agreement checkbox, a reCAPTCHA Enterprise widget, and a \"Begin Removal Process\" button #BRP. The page says it will confirm the request by email, so the run ends as awaiting_email_confirmation. Only the subject path is used. Nothing was submitted.",
  "verifiedAt": "2026-10-07",
  "liveStatus": "verified"
